{"unit_id":"tag:095T:statement","translation":"固有（Proper）基变换（Base Change）<OWNARGEND_0001>设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）的固有态射（proper morphism）。设<MATH_0002>为概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。置<MATH_0003>，并考虑笛卡尔（cartesian）图（diagram）\n<MATH_0004>\n。设<MATH_0005>为阿贝尔（abelian）挠（torsion）层（sheaf），它在<MATH_0006>上。则基变换（base change）映射（map）\n<MATH_0007>\n为同构（isomorphism）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Proper","target_term":"固有"},{"source_term":"Base Change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"proper morphism","target_term":"固有态射"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"cartesian","target_term":"笛卡尔"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"abelian","target_term":"阿贝尔"},{"source_term":"torsion","target_term":"挠"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Proper","target_term":"固有","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"Base Change","target_term":"基变换","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"proper morphism","target_term":"固有态射","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"cartesian","target_term":"笛卡尔","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"abelian","target_term":"阿贝尔","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"torsion","target_term":"挠","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"词表尚未批准"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:095T:proof","translation":"按上述术语，这意味着上同调（cohomology）与基变换（base change）交换（commutes），对于每个概形（schemes）的固有态射（proper morphism）而言。由引理<REF_0001>，只需证明上同调（cohomology）与基变换（base change）交换（commutes），对于态射（morphism）<MATH_0001>而言，对每个概形（scheme）<MATH_0002>均如此。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n设<MATH_0003>为严格 Hensel（strictly henselian）局部环（local ring）的谱（spectrum），具有闭点（closed point）<MATH_0004>。置<MATH_0005>和<MATH_0006>。设<MATH_0007>为层（sheaf），其取值为<MATH_0008>-模（modules），在<MATH_0009>上。证明的关键在于\n<MATH_0010>\n。具体地，选取消解（resolution）<MATH_0011>，由内射（injective）层（sheaves）组成，其取值为<MATH_0012>-模（modules）。则<MATH_0013>为<MATH_0014>的消解（resolution），由右<MATH_0015>-无环（acyclic）对象（objects）组成，见引理<REF_0002>。Leray 的无环性引理（acyclicity lemma）说明右端由复形（complex）<MATH_0016>计算，由引理<REF_0003>，它等于<MATH_0017>。此复形（complex）计算左端。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n假定<MATH_0018>为一般情形，<MATH_0019>为层（sheaf），其取值为<MATH_0020>-模（modules），在<MATH_0021>上。设<MATH_0022>为几何点（geometric point），它属于<MATH_0023>且位于<MATH_0024>之上。有\n<MATH_0025>\n，其中<MATH_0026>为剩余域（residue field），对应于<MATH_0027>，即<MATH_0028>在<MATH_0029>中的可分代数闭包（separable algebraic closure）。第一个等式由定理<REF_0004>得到，第二个等式由上一段的陈列公式得到。\n\n<STRUCT_0005><STRUCT_0006>\n最后，考虑任意概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）<MATH_0030>，其中<MATH_0031>和<MATH_0032>如上。置<MATH_0033>为投影（projection），令<MATH_0034>为态射（morphism），由<MATH_0035>诱导。考虑基变换（base change）映射（map）\n<MATH_0036>\n。设<MATH_0037>为几何点（geometric point），它属于<MATH_0038>，其像（image）为<MATH_0039>。由上述讨论，茎（stalks）上的映射（map），在<MATH_0040>处，是映射（map）\n<MATH_0041>\n。由于<MATH_0042>，此映射（map）为同构（isomorphism），由引理<REF_0005>得到。\n\n<STRUCT_0007><STRUCT_0008>\n这证明上同调（cohomology）与基变换（base change）交换（commutes），对于<MATH_0043>及取值为<MATH_0044>-模（modules）的层（sheaves）而言。特别地，对于内射（injective）层（sheaf），其取值为<MATH_0045>-模（modules），任意基变换（base change）的高阶直像（direct images）为零。换言之，引理<REF_0006>的条件 (2) 成立，证明完毕。\n","allowed_english":["Leray"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换"},{"source_ter