{"unit_id":"tag:0DDE:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）的固有态射（proper morphism）。设<MATH_0002>为概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。置<MATH_0003>，将<MATH_0004>和<MATH_0005>记为投影（projections）。设<MATH_0006>具有挠（torsion）上同调层（cohomology sheaves）。则基变换（base change）映射（map）（<REF_0001>）\n<MATH_0007>\n为同构（isomorphism）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"proper morphism","target_term":"固有态射"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"projections","target_term":"投影"},{"source_term":"torsion","target_term":"挠"},{"source_term":"cohomology sheaves","target_term":"上同调层"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"proper morphism","target_term":"固有态射","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"projections","target_term":"投影","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"torsion","target_term":"挠","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"cohomology sheaves","target_term":"上同调层","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"词表尚未批准"}],"notes":[]}
